    /begin CHARACTERISTIC ACC_decel_limit_curve_3_0_clamp_C_AC_SP_LIM_NEG_path "THE -3.0 m/s2 brake-decel clamp (openpilot decel lever). Values @file 0x5b71c (6x u16), axis @file 0x5a4c6 (6x u16). Read at 8013c5d4:220 (acc_brake_request_formation); input = filtered vehicle-speed class (Ramd0007ce8). All 6 cells = 0x7237 = -3.000 m/s2 (FLAT). z-encoding OFFSET-BINARY u16 LE: phys=(X-32768)*0.00085; 0x6db1=-3.984 (packer floor), 0x8000=0. Lowering cells (0x7237->0x6db1) RELAXES the cap (allows harder braking) since 8013c5d4:418 does max(request,cell). x-axis scale 0.01 km/h (=10/20/50/80/120/180 km/h) INFERRED from filtered d5618 vehicle-speed class -- see acc_flow.md. Recompute cal checksum after edit."
