    /begin CHARACTERISTIC speed_limiter_setpoint_table_43c2c "ROLE (VERIFIED, code): vehicle-speed (Vmax) limiter setpoint table. 5x u16 @0x43c2c indexed by DAT_d000b3bb (0-4; [0-3]=full, [4]=reduced), read as *(u16*)(sel*2 + 0x80043c2c) in 800dd3a4.c:70-74 and 8017338c.c:33-46. The value is consumed IN VEHICLE-SPEED UNITS -- speed error = clamp(Ramd0005618 - setpoint) -> limiter flag UNK_d0001711 + PI governor -> limiting torque Ramd0007fec (8017338c.c:456-533). A quantity subtracted from road speed to form an error MUST be a speed => not torque/rpm/temp/load. FR-NAME (CANDIDATE): V_PVS_MAX / VHSL ch.71 (def p.11385) -- right chapter+role, but FR carries no addresses so the exact token is unproven. SCALING (CANDIDATE): 1/128 km/h => 32000=250.0, stock 20300~159. TUNE: [0-3] 20300->30000->32000."
