    /begin CHARACTERISTIC torque_monitor_permissible_dev_40940 "ROLE (VERIFIED, code): engine-torque monitor two-sided permissible-deviation curves. FUN_8013273c builds deviation = min(torque_model@0x49174, Ramd0007616) - ref, tests it vs kl_interp curves 0x4093e (positive/upper) and 0x40946 (negative/lower), offset-binary (thr-0x8000); exceedance -> debounce -> fault 0x10/0x11 -> DTC latch update_control_flags_800a8b20 (DAT_d0009fbc..). The ONLY consequence is a fault/DTC (no torque/actuator output on this path) => a MONITOR, not a control clamp. Larger cell => harder to trip. FR-NAME (CANDIDATE): Momentenueberwachung / EGAS L2 -- role-accurate, but the specific FR characteristic token is not pinned (several torque monitors exist). TUNE: STAGE2 first cells @0x40940 -> 0xFFFF => over-torque can never assert (monitor defeated); Stage1 stock. Raw internal torque unit."
